text":"在雅各的上帝面前颤抖，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为祂使磐石变成水池，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使岩石涌出泉水。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/114.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/115.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/113.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}